- Incumbent hype text: [`.cursor/rules/incumbent-hype-text.mdc`](incumbent-hype-text.mdc) + [`.cursor/agents/content-swipe/INCUMBENT_HYPE_TEXT.md`](../agents/content-swipe/INCUMBENT_HYPE_TEXT.md)

## Do not

- Dump a feature list with no launch spine
- Bury the product name under throat-clearing
- Invent endpoints, percentages, or “live” status
- Open holder-moon angles on a builder product launch
- Force `X is live.` when the user asked for **incumbent hype** / `/incumbent` (use that named format instead)
